OL,3,GNEWSAInside the raid where dog finds
OL,4,Ahidden cigarette stash
OL,5,
OL,6,FGriff the sniffer dog will not move. He
OL,7,Fis inside a shop suspected of illegal
OL,8,Ftrading and, while his paws scratch
OL,9,Finside a kitchen cabinet, he looks at
OL,10,Fhis handler and barks to signal
OL,11,Fsomething is here.
OL,13,FI have joined Lincolnshire Police and
OL,14,FTrading Standards on a chilly evening
OL,15,Fas they simultaneously raid four shops
OL,16,Fin Boston, Lincolnshire.
OL,18,FAll are suspected to be fronts for
OL,19,Fillegal activity from the sale of
OL,20,Fillicit cigarettes.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
