OL,3,GNEWSAInside the raid where dog finds
OL,4,Ahidden cigarette stash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is dark in the market town. The
OL,7,Ffaint hum of the town's fair can be
OL,8,Fheard in the distance as the flashing
OL,9,Fblue lights of police cars illuminate
OL,10,Fthe streets.
